rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>旅行<rp>(</rp><rt>りょこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>仕事<rp>(</rp><rt>しごと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じゃなくて<ruby>遊<rp>(</rp><rt>あそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>びです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我们的下次旅行是愉快的 不是工作</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">集まる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あつまる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">聚集；汇集；集合</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"125642\"><ruby>通<rp>(</rp><rt>とお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りに<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がたくさん<ruby>集<rp>(</rp><rt>あつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まっている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">街上有很多人</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\" data-id=\"n4:v:集める\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">集める</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あつめる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">收集</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>弟<rp>(</rp><rt>おとうと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>切手<rp>(</rp><rt>きって</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>集<rp>(</rp><rt>あつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めています。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">弟弟在集邮。</span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">アナウンサー</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">播音员；主持人；广播员；记者；（综艺节目中负责外景轻松报道的）电视台内部艺人</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"234281\">アナウンサーは<ruby>早口<rp>(</rp><rt>はやくち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>出来<rp>(</rp><rt>でき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">播音员可以快速说话</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">アフリカ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">非洲</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"230388\">アフリカにはたくさんの<ruby>自然<rp>(</rp><rt>しぜん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">非洲具有许多自然特性。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">アメリカ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">美利坚合众国；美国；美利坚；美洲；美洲大陆</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"157652\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>去年<rp>(</rp><rt>きょねん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>秋<rp>(</rp><rt>あき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にアメリカにいった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">去年秋天我去了美国</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">謝る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あやまる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">道歉；认错；拒绝；推辞；承受不住；不敌；无可奈何；认输</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"153353\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>謝<rp>(</rp><rt>あやま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らなければならない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我不得不向她道歉。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/339474\" title=\"Tatoeba · nickyeow\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · nickyeow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">アルコール</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">酒精；酒；含酒精饮料；酒精洗手液；含酒精消毒液</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"223288\">このビールはアルコール<ruby>分<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が５％だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这啤酒含有5%的酒精。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">アルバイト</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">兼职；副业；兼职工作者；打工者</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">安心</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あんしん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">安心；放心；心安；安全感；保障；自信</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"234664\">あいつに<ruby>仕事<rp>(</rp><rt>しごと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>任<rp>(</rp><rt>まか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>せておけば<ruby>安心<rp>(</rp><rt>あんしん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你可以信任他 任何工作。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">安全</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あんぜん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">安全；保障</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"165729\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちは<ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っているほど<ruby>安全<rp>(</rp><rt>あんぜん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ではない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我们不是所有的安全。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">あんな</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">连体词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">連体詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">那样的；那种；像那样的；如此的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"75577\">あんないい<ruby>男<rp>(</rp><rt>おとこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>そうそういないぞ！！</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">没有什么家伙这么好!</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">案内</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あんない</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">引导；带路；指引；信息；通知；告知；来访通报；通报访客到来；邀请；邀约；相识；了解；知晓</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"152174\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をあちこちに<ruby>案内<rp>(</rp><rt>あんない</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>してください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">请带我参观一下</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">家</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いえ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/kanji/\">N5</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a><span class=\"v-m\">家；房子</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n4/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">家</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">以下</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"v-m\">不超过……；……以下；……或以下；……或更少；低于（某标准、水平等）；在……以下；不足……；以下；下述；下列；其余部分；后接……；包括……在内；……及其他（员工、官员等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"205034\">それは<ruby>千円<rp>(</rp><rt>せんえん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>以下<rp>(</rp><rt>いか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>では<ruby>買<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えません。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你买不到1000日元</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">以外</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いがい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"v-m\">除外；除了；除…以外；另外；此外；范围外；界限外</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"210309\">その<ruby>仕事<rp>(</rp><rt>しごと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>以外<rp>(</rp><rt>いがい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ならなんでもやる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">除了那份工作,我什么都愿意做</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">医学</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いがく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">医学；医学科学</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"123119\"><ruby>二人<rp>(</rp><rt>ふたり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>医者<rp>(</rp><rt>いしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>医学<rp>(</rp><rt>いがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はなし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をしていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">有两个医生在谈生意</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">生きる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いきる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">活着；生存；谋生；维持生计；生效；起作用；有效；复活；变得有生气；（棒球、围棋等）安全；存活</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"142836\"><ruby>生<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きるものはすべていつかは<ruby>死<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぬ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">所有的活物总有一天会死的</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\" data-id=\"n4:v:意見\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">意見</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いけん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">意见</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\">みんなの<ruby>意見<rp>(</rp><rt>いけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>聞<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いてから<ruby>決<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めます。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">听了大家的意见再决定。</span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">石</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">石头；岩石；卵石；宝石；珠宝；打火石；棋子；围棋子；黑白棋子；结石；（膀胱、肾脏等的）结石</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"164717\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にはこの<ruby>石<rp>(</rp><rt>いし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>持<rp>(</rp><rt>も</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ち<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がらない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我不能举起这块石头。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">いじめる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">欺凌；欺负；折磨；嘲弄；残害；迫害；苛待；严苛对待</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"110371\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はよく<ruby>友人<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆうじん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をいじめたものだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他以前欺负他的朋友</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">以上</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いじょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"v-m\">不少于……；……以上；……及以上；……或更多；超出（如超出预期）；超越；多于；进一步；上述；上述的；前述；前面提到的；既然……；由于……；既然如此；一旦……；仅此而已；到此为止；结束</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"191216\"><ruby>以上<rp>(</rp><rt>いじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ですか？</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">就这样?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">急ぐ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いそぐ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a><span class=\"v-m\">赶紧</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n4/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">急</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">致す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いたす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">做；进行（谦）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227085\">お<ruby>取<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>寄<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>せいたしましょうか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">要我点吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">いただく</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">接受；获得；领取；购买；吃；喝；戴在头上；顶着；拥戴为首领；在…统治下生活；任命为总统；让某人做某事；请某人做某事</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"179544\"><ruby>九時<rp>(</rp><rt>くじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ていただきたいのですが。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我希望你能九点来</span></div></li>"]